\f0\fs24 \cf0 Notes for Instructors:\
\
There are three primary folders in this directory:\
- Resources\
- Course development\
- Data Science - N&C - for students\
\
Resources: This contains a powerpoint used to introduce the course on Day 1, as well as two excel files that students can add on Days 1 and 2. The species lists help limit the scope of issues that students may encounter when working with their own species.\
