\cf0 Course development: This is the working folder when used to develop the modules. It contains both the original Rmd files as well as the html files for each day, and all the associated files needed to edit the course. Use the Rmd files in the folder \'93development\'94 to edit and tweak information presented to students, then copy over and replace the html files in the folder \'91Data Science - N&C - for students\'92 when you\'92re satisfied that they are ready.\
\
Data Science - N&C - for students: this folder is intended to store all files needed for the student computers. When delivering this course in a university classroom, the instructors pre-loaded each of the student computers with this folder and this folder became the working directory for the students in R.}